<!doctype html>
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Mautic Inbox — App Review WebChat</title><style>
:root{font:16px/1.6 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",sans-serif;color:#202c40;background:#f4f6fa}*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0}main{max-width:1050px;padding:32px 20px 48px;margin:auto}.brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;font-weight:700}.logo{background:#244184;color:white;border-radius:12px;width:40px;height:40px;display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:24px}.eyebrow{margin:30px 0 8px;color:#53647b;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase}h1{font-size:clamp(28px,5vw,40px);line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:-.025em;margin:0 0 16px}.intro{max-width:640px;color:#53647b}.layout{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(300px,410px);gap:32px;margin-top:28px}.step{display:flex;gap:14px;margin-bottom:24px}.number{flex:none;width:28px;height:28px;background:#e6ecf7;color:#244184;border-radius:50%;text-align:center;font-weight:700}.step p{margin:4px 0;color:#53647b;font-size:14px}strong{font-weight:650}iframe{width:100%;height:640px;border:1px solid #e2e7ef;border-radius:20px;background:white;box-shadow:0 12px 36px #14223a0d}.note{border-top:1px solid #e2e7ef;padding-top:16px;color:#657289;font-size:13px}a{color:#244184}footer{margin-top:32px;color:#657289;font-size:13px;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:16px}@media(max-width:740px){main{padding-top:20px}.layout{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:12px}iframe{height:600px}.eyebrow{margin-top:24px}}@media(prefers-color-scheme:dark){:root{color:#edf2fb;background:#090c12}.intro,.step p,.note,footer{color:#abb7c9}.number{background:#1b2946;color:#bbcffa}iframe,.note{border-color:#293242}a{color:#bbcffa}}
</style></head><body><main><div class="brand"><span class="logo">m</span>Mautic Inbox</div><p class="eyebrow">App Review · Live WebChat</p><h1>Test both sides of a conversation.</h1><p class="intro">This page connects to a dedicated evaluation inbox on Mautic. Send a message here as a visitor, then reply from the iOS app using the review account.</p><div class="layout"><section aria-label="Review instructions"><div class="step"><span class="number">1</span><div><strong>Connect the iOS app</strong><p>Use <b>https://mkt-macro.on-forge.com</b>. Choose “Entrar pela página do Mautic” and sign in with the username and password provided privately in App Review Notes. Confirm “Conectar Mautic Inbox”.</p></div></div><div class="step"><span class="number">2</span><div><strong>Send a visitor message</strong><p>Open the chat beside these instructions and send a short message such as “Hello from App Review”. No email address or phone number is required.</p></div></div><div class="step"><span class="number">3</span><div><strong>Reply from the app</strong><p>Open the conversation in the app’s inbox. It is assigned to the review account automatically. Send a reply and check that it arrives here.</p></div></div><div class="step"><span class="number">4</span><div><strong>Check push notifications</strong><p>Allow notifications on the iPhone, put the app in the background and send another visitor message from this page. Tap the notification to return to the conversation.</p></div></div><p class="note">Evaluation conversations are isolated by user permissions. The review account cannot view customer conversations. This is a real connection; messages are stored in Mautic. Review credentials are shared only through App Review Notes.</p></section><iframe id="review-chat" title="Live evaluation WebChat" src="{{ path('mautic_webchat_widget', {publicKey: widget.publicKey}) }}" allow="clipboard-write; autoplay"></iframe></div><footer><a href="https://mautic-inbox-privacidade-e-suporte.me-21d3.chatgpt.site/privacidade/">Privacy policy</a><a href="https://mautic-inbox-privacidade-e-suporte.me-21d3.chatgpt.site/suporte/">Support</a><span>iOS · Mautic Inbox</span></footer></main><script nonce="{{ nonce }}">
(function () {
  const frame = document.getElementById('review-chat');
  const origin = window.location.origin;
  window.addEventListener('message', function (event) {
    if (event.source !== frame.contentWindow || event.origin !== origin || event.data?.type !== 'webchat.ready') return;
    frame.contentWindow.postMessage({type: 'webchat.bootstrap', siteOrigin: origin, pageUrl: origin + window.location.pathname, user: {}, context: {locale: 'en', appearance: 'light'}}, origin);
    frame.contentWindow.postMessage({type: 'webchat.command', action: 'open'}, origin);
  });
})();
</script></body></html>
